# Hromada Strategy Collaboration Mapping

NLP matching of Ukrainian hromada development strategies for МСС candidate discovery.
Spin-out from w3i-network (2026-07-23); NocoDB `Hromadas` table still shared.

## Read first

- [README.md](../../README.md) — status, setup, commands
- [docs/project-history.md](../../docs/project-history.md) — full methodology history (replaces Claude memory)
- [docs/hromadas-schema.md](../../docs/hromadas-schema.md) — field schema
- [docs/kse-synergy.md](../../docs/kse-synergy.md) — KSE join rules
